@startuml 03-implantacao
title OrbitaPay — Implantação (docker compose · rede orbita 172.30.0.0/24)

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI"

node "Dispositivo do usuário" {
  artifact "App Expo" as app
  artifact "Navegador" as nav
}

node "Host Docker · rede orbita" {
  node "gateway\n172.30.0.80" as gw <<container>>
  note right of gw : localhost:**8080**

  node "rabbitmq\n172.30.0.10" as mq <<container>>
  note right of mq : localhost:5672 (AMQP) · localhost:15672 (painel)

  node "auth\n172.30.0.86" as aut <<container>>
  node "clientes\n172.30.0.81" as cli <<container>>
  node "contas\n172.30.0.82" as con <<container>>
  node "ativos\n172.30.0.83" as atv <<container>>
  node "negociacao\n172.30.0.84" as neg <<container>>
  node "carteira\n172.30.0.85" as car <<container>>
  node "pagamentos\n172.30.0.87" as pag <<container>>
  node "relatorios\n172.30.0.88" as rel <<container>>

  database "mongo-auth\n172.30.0.186" as m0
  database "mongo-clientes\n172.30.0.181" as m1
  database "mongo-contas\n172.30.0.182" as m2
  database "mongo-ativos\n172.30.0.183" as m3
  database "mongo-negociacao\n172.30.0.184" as m4
  database "mongo-carteira\n172.30.0.185" as m5
  database "mongo-pagamentos\n172.30.0.187" as m6
  database "mongo-relatorios\n172.30.0.188" as m7
}

app --> gw : HTTP :8080
nav --> mq : painel :15672
gw --> aut : :8086
gw --> cli : :8081
gw --> con : :8082
gw --> atv : :8083
gw --> neg : :8084
gw --> car : :8085
gw --> pag : :8087
gw --> rel : :8088

aut --> m0
cli --> m1
con --> m2
atv --> m3
neg --> m4
car --> m5
pag --> m6
rel --> m7

aut ..> mq : AMQP
cli ..> mq : AMQP
con ..> mq : AMQP
atv ..> mq : AMQP
neg ..> mq : AMQP
car ..> mq : AMQP
pag ..> mq : AMQP
rel ..> mq : AMQP

note bottom of neg
  Ordem de subida (depends_on):
  1. rabbitmq + mongos
  2. auth, contas, negociacao, carteira, relatorios (declaram filas)
  3. pagamentos, ativos, clientes (publicam; clientes precisa do auth)
  4. gateway
  Regra dos IPs: o final do IP é a porta do serviço.
end note
@enduml
